### Local application state ###
# The development blob store. `application-local.yml` points at ~/.barometr/blobs;
# app/.data is where it wrote before that was fixed, and holds tens of thousands of
# archived payloads. Ignored rather than deleted here — it is real fetched data, and
# re-fetching RCL at one request per five seconds is not free.
.data/
*.data/

### IntelliJ, per-developer state ###
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/kotlinc.xml
.idea/shelf/
